@title WarioWare - Twisted! (USA)
@file WarioWare - Twisted! (U).gba
@game RZWE
@chip SRAM
@frozen dingbat-bios,mgba
# Health screen, intro, title, How To Play, Modes, Story, Wario's stage: the scene waits for the player to wind
# the watch by turning the console (`gyro 0.6`), then the stage's microgames, played by turning back and forth
# (shaving, a swinging rope, ...) with A, to the souvenir toy; START pauses, a turn moves the cursor to EXIT, and
# the Story map shows the stage not cleared. The game has written its save by then; [load] boots it to Story.
# Picked for the cart's Z-axis gyro (a serial ADC on the GPIO pins, read every frame) and rumble.
# Recorded in lockstep on dingbat-bios and mgba only: the second reference has no gyro input (its public
# API offers none), so the `gyro` steps do nothing there and it stays at the watch scene from wind_watch on.
# The microgames' random layouts differ between emulators (the shaving stubble at f7394), so they win and
# lose different ones; both reach the souvenir toy on the same frame.

[new]
wait 600
checkpoint health_safety window=30
press A
wait 300
checkpoint intro window=30
press START
wait 240
checkpoint title window=30
press START
wait 240
checkpoint how_to_play window=30
wait 600
press A
wait 120
wait 400
press A
wait 200
press START
wait 200
checkpoint modes window=30
press A
wait 300
checkpoint story_select window=30
press A
wait 600
wait 300
checkpoint cutscene window=30
press START
wait 300
tap A times=10 every=60 hold=4
wait 600
checkpoint wind_watch window=30
gyro 0.6
wait 180
gyro 0
